This project includes concepts and design inspiration from Coxswain:

1. Program structure and workout segment logic
2. Bluetooth connectivity approach for PM5/C2 rowers
3. Workout metrics and data organization
4. Core rowing training concepts

Major changes in this derivative work:
- Complete rewrite from Java/Android to JavaScript/React
- Progressive Web App architecture
- Modern UI with Tailwind CSS
- Browser-based implementation using Web Bluetooth API
- Simplified feature set focused on core functionality
- No original source code retained from Coxswain

